WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.304 --> 00:00:02.192
- Nope, not on camera.

00:00:02.192 --> 00:00:04.411
I wanna give you a piece of advice.

00:00:04.411 --> 00:00:06.282
Stuff gets on the internet
and it doesn't go away.

00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:07.171
You hear me?

00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:10.254
This is actually very salient advice.

00:00:12.738 --> 00:00:15.169
Hi, my name is Kate McKinnon,
I'm here with BuzzFeed.

00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:17.238
I'm going to answer some fan questions

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:19.340
about the upcoming animated film Leap

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.079
and some other stuff

00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:24.591
and I'm gonna play with
puppies while I do it.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.008
Hello little one.

00:00:27.987 --> 00:00:29.237
Yes, hello, hi.

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.874
Hi little ones, hello.

00:00:32.874 --> 00:00:34.131
(squeaky dog toy)

00:00:34.131 --> 00:00:35.139
You over here.

00:00:35.139 --> 00:00:37.084
I'm gonna call you Paul.

00:00:37.084 --> 00:00:39.917
And your name will be Grizzabelle.

00:00:40.826 --> 00:00:43.702
You know, tough to answer questions while

00:00:43.702 --> 00:00:47.285
there is such sweetness
and love abounding.

00:00:53.825 --> 00:00:56.471
I have had only positive interactions

00:00:56.471 --> 00:01:00.417
in relation to my impressions of people,

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:05.038
which makes me happy
because I do them with love

00:01:05.038 --> 00:01:08.378
and I hope that the
people who I do them of

00:01:08.378 --> 00:01:11.878
really like them, isn't that right Angela?

00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:19.810
You know its really fun just
running around backstage

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.559
when everyone's getting changed

00:01:22.559 --> 00:01:26.607
and it feels like a middle
school play all over again.

00:01:26.607 --> 00:01:29.274
Sometimes you see someone naked.

00:01:33.462 --> 00:01:36.021
The trick is, I guess, fear.

00:01:36.021 --> 00:01:38.821
You don't wanna ruin it by laughing.

00:01:38.821 --> 00:01:40.071
But I often do.

00:01:41.362 --> 00:01:43.314
We haven't spoken much.

00:01:43.314 --> 00:01:46.231
John, what is it like being so cute

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.553
that you should be eaten?

00:01:51.182 --> 00:01:54.765
Is it hard knowing that
you should be eaten

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.167
because you're so cute?

00:02:02.707 --> 00:02:06.461
I think my Emmy award has
run away to another continent

00:02:06.461 --> 00:02:11.103
because I have not heard
from him or her in months.

00:02:11.103 --> 00:02:12.927
Oh you don't like that jacket?

00:02:12.927 --> 00:02:15.007
You think that's a bad fashion choice?

00:02:15.007 --> 00:02:18.271
Let's see what we can do with this jacket.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:21.849
I am a cool dude, my name is Rachel.

00:02:21.849 --> 00:02:24.349
Look at what a cool dude I am.

00:02:29.425 --> 00:02:32.138
You gotta believe in yourself
and you just have to work

00:02:32.138 --> 00:02:35.844
harder at it than you've ever
worked at anything before

00:02:35.844 --> 00:02:36.908
in your life.

00:02:36.908 --> 00:02:39.748
And if you keep doing that
and keep believing in yourself

00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:41.440
great things do happen.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:45.958
You just have to work super
hard and if you have a passion,

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.313
that's the most beautiful thing in life

00:02:48.313 --> 00:02:51.318
and you just have to
bust out and do it baby.

00:02:51.318 --> 00:02:54.156
My passion used to be comedy but now

00:02:54.156 --> 00:02:57.323
it is these four puppies, exclusively.

00:03:02.819 --> 00:03:03.652
AHHH!

00:03:10.886 --> 00:03:12.969
Can we have lunch please?

00:03:13.913 --> 00:03:15.580
Can we stop and eat?

00:03:17.487 --> 00:03:20.981
We never eat, have you noticed that?

00:03:20.981 --> 00:03:23.199
We're working our way through.

00:03:23.199 --> 00:03:26.085
Do their mouths smell like garbage?

00:03:26.085 --> 00:03:26.918
Yeah.

00:03:28.025 --> 00:03:30.808
Do I want them to kiss me on the mouth?

00:03:30.808 --> 00:03:31.641
Yeah.

00:03:36.811 --> 00:03:38.810
That's an interesting question.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.584
There is no backstory,
I just like to salute.

00:03:41.584 --> 00:03:43.427
And I guess it became a thing.

00:03:43.427 --> 00:03:44.594
Hey, hey, hey.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.717
My son Nino who I hope
is not watching this

00:03:53.717 --> 00:03:57.065
because he would not like to see me

00:03:57.065 --> 00:03:58.982
fawning over some dogs.

00:04:00.586 --> 00:04:03.581
He's doing very well even though

00:04:03.581 --> 00:04:07.748
it is very hot in the summer
and he doesn't love that.

00:04:13.619 --> 00:04:17.492
Before 10 minutes ago it might
have been something different

00:04:17.492 --> 00:04:20.075
but now it is, Swimming in Fur.

00:04:22.091 --> 00:04:24.158
Do you wanna read the question, Rachel?

00:04:24.158 --> 00:04:26.187
Read that, read that question.

00:04:26.187 --> 00:04:27.833
Can you read English?

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:29.800
No, you can only read Russian.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:32.104
He's cute but he doesn't have a future

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:34.604
as a professional interviewer.

00:04:40.026 --> 00:04:43.315
I think sometimes you don't get to-

00:04:43.315 --> 00:04:44.148
hello.

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.633
You don't get to- hello.

00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:49.772
Oh you wanna play fetch?

00:04:49.772 --> 00:04:51.880
You're not in the room
with the people that you're

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.274
acting against and sometimes you've done

00:04:54.274 --> 00:04:55.916
your parts on different days.

00:04:55.916 --> 00:04:58.587
Do you wanna ... Grizzabelle ...

00:04:58.587 --> 00:04:59.971
You're Rufus.

00:04:59.971 --> 00:05:04.138
So sometimes you don't get to
see who you're acting against.

00:05:08.832 --> 00:05:10.395
Oh my goodness.

00:05:10.395 --> 00:05:15.042
Maddie Ziegler is the most
amazing dancer I've ever seen.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:16.996
And I'm so obsessed with her.

00:05:16.996 --> 00:05:20.279
I was obsessed with her even before

00:05:20.279 --> 00:05:22.612
she did her first Sia video.

00:05:23.899 --> 00:05:25.085
What are you eating?

00:05:25.085 --> 00:05:26.002
And so- Ow.

00:05:27.397 --> 00:05:29.480
You're a stinker, Rachel.

00:05:30.758 --> 00:05:34.220
I was so excited that she was doing this

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:38.334
because I'm so obsessed
with her as an artist

00:05:38.334 --> 00:05:41.969
and she's so young and
it's crazy that she's so,

00:05:41.969 --> 00:05:44.136
such an amazing innovator.

00:05:45.119 --> 00:05:47.516
Will you do me a favor, Rachel and just

00:05:47.516 --> 00:05:50.361
go into my pocket and stay there?

00:05:50.361 --> 00:05:55.281
I'm gonna walk out of here
and just don't leave okay?

00:05:55.281 --> 00:05:59.228
You can come to my house
and live in my house.

00:05:59.228 --> 00:06:00.895
How does that sound?

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.020
He said yes.

00:06:04.278 --> 00:06:05.462
He?

00:06:05.462 --> 00:06:06.295
Yep.

00:06:07.878 --> 00:06:10.601
Just in conclusion, all of these

00:06:10.601 --> 00:06:13.399
fabulous little puppies are adoptable

00:06:13.399 --> 00:06:15.871
at North Shore Animal League America,

00:06:15.871 --> 00:06:19.914
which happens to be where
I got my son Nino from.

00:06:19.914 --> 00:06:22.715
And all of my childhood cats as well.

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:24.067
It's an incredible facility.

00:06:24.067 --> 00:06:28.299
Thank you so much for
lending me these friends.

00:06:28.299 --> 00:06:30.712
And would someone please
take them into their homes

00:06:30.712 --> 00:06:33.635
because Nino would get too jealous.

00:06:33.635 --> 00:06:36.026
All of the puppies have left me.

00:06:36.026 --> 00:06:38.359
What does that say about me?

